<center><b>Welcome to the Horizon Events Signup Form. Please select the event you are interested in attending from the drop down box below.</b></center>
<form action="signup.cgi" method="POST">
Select an existing event:
<select name="eventfile"><option value="TiKa3082.txt">Karnor's Castle Thursday</option><option value="TiKa7318.txt">Karnor's Castle Saturday</option><option value="TiKa971.txt">Karnor's Castle Friday</option><option value="ToAC551.txt">AC hunt</option></select><br>
<input type="submit" value="Register for Event" name="registerbutton">
<input type="submit" value="View this Event" name="viewevent">
</form>
